{"id":"bddf941f3df73d10","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-top7-extremally-disconnected-space.md","title":"ZFC Top7 Extremally Disconnected Space","display":"df-zfc-top7-extremally-disconnected-space — ZFC Top7 Extremally Disconnected Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top7-extremally-disconnected-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top7-extremally-disconnected-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top7-extremally-disconnected-space — ZFC Top7 Extremally Disconnected Space","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top7-extremally-disconnected-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top7-extremally-disconnected-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top7-extremally-disconnected-space — ZFC Top7 Extremally Disconnected Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (carrier set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (topology candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\)</span> (closure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ExtremallyDisconnectedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ExtremallyDisconnectedSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}extremally\\text{-}disconnected\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ExtremallyDisconnectedSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists C\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,U,C)\n\\land\nC\\in\\tau\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}extremally\\text{-}disconnected\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ExtremallyDisconnectedSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists C\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,U,C)\n\\land\nC\\in\\tau\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The closure is now tied to the declared space by the upstream closure predicate, and the topology guard is explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S$ (closure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ExtremallyDisconnectedSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}extremally\\text{-}disconnected\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ExtremallyDisconnectedSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists C\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,U,C)\n\\land\nC\\in\\tau\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1354,"backlinks":[{"id":"613492cca30d41cb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ExtremallyDisconnectedSpace}_S$ (extremally disconnected-space predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-top7-extremally-disconnected-space.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3628","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-top7-extremally-disconnected-space.md|58-df-zfc-top7-extremally-disconnected-space]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","74086485fba8d86f","9ac97ecaeb21258a"]}